From: Aurora <aurora@child-of-light-recomp.local>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 04:25:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 17/15] recompiler: implement cror, crorc, ldbrx, ldux, lfdux,
 stdux (Child of Light needs)

Batch D (loads/stores/CR): 6 mnemonics, 76 unrecognized sites in
analysis/xenonrecomp-run4.log (stdux 30, ldux 26, ldbrx 15, lfdux 1,
cror 2, crorc 2).

- cror/crorc: CR bit OR (and OR with complement), same CR_BIT_NAMES
  shape as the existing branch-on-CR code.
- ldbrx: byte-reversed doubleword load — one more bswap64 on top of
  PPC_LOAD_U64, same shape as LWBRX/LHBRX one size up.
- ldux/lfdux/stdux: update-form indexed loads/stores (EA = rA + rB,
  write EA back to rA), same EA-then-writeback shape as LDU/LFDU/STDU.

All 6 Capstone IDs verified in thirdparty/disasm/ppc-inst.h; all 6
cases were genuinely absent from the tree (no duplicates).

---
diff --git a/XenonRecomp/recompiler.cpp b/XenonRecomp/recompiler.cpp
--- a/XenonRecomp/recompiler.cpp
+++ b/XenonRecomp/recompiler.cpp
@@ -884,7 +884,15 @@
